# goto around things (#161), the playtester's repro on
# maps/launchertest.vmap. The straight path from the start (2,5) to (14,8)
# runs through the middle AMBUSH Mutt Trooper at (12,5); goto plans around
# tiles holding a live thing (enemy, barrel) and arrives. Then the pistol
# shoots the kibble barrel at (15,8) next to the goal; its blast kills the
# Mutt at (15,9) and hurts the player standing 1 u away.
vsdemo 1
level 1
skill 2
seed 0
map launchertest
goto 14 8
expect tile=14,8
face 15 8
fire 40
wait 20
